1
00:00:00,270 --> 00:00:02,560
(Howard:)If not, my mom's trying
to sneak in the doctor...

2
00:00:02,773 --> 00:00:04,653
(Howard:)...who sucked the fat out of her neck.

3
00:00:08,695 --> 00:00:09,735
All right, uh, fine.

4
00:00:09,946 --> 00:00:11,906
(Raj:)I'm coming and I'm bringing somebody.

5
00:00:12,115 --> 00:00:13,445
(Raj:)Koothrappali plus one.

6
00:00:13,658 --> 00:00:16,498
(Penny:)- Who are you bringing?
- Who are you bringing?

7
00:00:16,703 --> 00:00:18,743
(Penny:)He's bringing me. Who are you bringing?

8
00:00:18,955 --> 00:00:22,415
(Raj:)Wow, what a bunch of Nosey O'Donnells.

9
00:00:23,126 --> 00:00:24,756
(Howard:)Come on, who is it?

10
00:00:24,961 --> 00:00:28,801
(Raj:)I'm not telling. I'm from Asia.
I'm mysterious. Deal with it.

11
00:00:30,133 --> 00:00:32,593
(Sheldon:)Howard, are you having
a make-your-own-sundae bar?

12
00:00:32,803 --> 00:00:34,513
(Howard:)Uh, I don't think so.

13
00:00:34,721 --> 00:00:37,561
(Sheldon:)Well, you should.
Fifty percent of marriages end in divorce.

14
00:00:37,766 --> 00:00:43,026
But 100 percent of make-your-own-sundae
bars end in happiness.

